# The bundled uBlock Origin extension (app/src/main/assets/ublock_origin/) is a vendored,
# unmodified third-party tree that includes signature/integrity manifests
# (META-INF/mozilla.sf, cose.manifest) - treat it as binary so Git never rewrites line endings
# in it on checkout (e.g. LF -> CRLF on Windows), which could otherwise corrupt those manifests
# or any file whose exact bytes the extension loader/signature check might care about.
app/src/main/assets/ublock_origin/** -text
